#
# Driven by porting/runners/ruby/delegation-probe. These are the boundaries no
# CLI surface reaches: `check` can only report on delegations a fixture store
# legally carries, and nothing prints `ordered`, `unknown_keys`, or `stamp`.
# Claim/release semantics are campaign 4 and are deliberately absent.

